This product is an unofficial graphical front end for hey-bro-check-log
(hbcl). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the hbcl authors or
maintainers.

This product bundles (in the Windows executable) and depends on
hey-bro-check-log, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  - Original hey-bro-check-log by ligh7s
    https://github.com/ligh7s/hey-bro-check-log
  - Maintained by the doujin café Discord community
    https://github.com/doujincafe/hbcl
  - EAC checksum check implementation from eac_logsigner by puddly
    https://github.com/puddly/eac_logsigner
  - XLD checksum check implementation from xld_logchecker.py by OPSnet
    https://github.com/OPSnet/xld_logchecker.py

The Windows executable additionally bundles third-party components under
their own licenses:
  - CPython (Python Software Foundation License) and Tcl/Tk (Tcl/Tk license)
  - tkinterdnd2 (MIT) and the tkdnd extension (BSD-style)
  - chardet (LGPL-2.1+ / see package), faust-cchardet (MPL-1.1/GPL/LGPL),
    pprp (see package)
  - PyInstaller bootloader (GPL-2.0 with bootloader exception)
